# Keep the build context small and reproducible: never ship local build output,
# installed deps (restored/installed inside the image), dev DB or secrets.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
frontend/.env
frontend/.env.*
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
# Note: frontend/openapi.json IS kept — the frontend build regenerates its types
# from it, and the backend build is told not to regenerate it in-image.
